%% 滚动条拖拽（只改 state + notify，红线 4）
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant SB as HScrollbar(div)
    participant V as SheetView
    participant S as SheetViewState
    participant C as canvas(重绘)

    U->>SB: mouse_down(thumb / track)
    SB->>V: on_drag(target_scroll_x, window, cx)
    V->>S: set_scroll_x(value, viewport_w, total_w)
    S->>S: clamp([0, max(0, total-viewport)])
    V->>V: cx.notify()
    V->>C: 下一帧 render 重绘（thumb 同步）

    Note over SB: 拖拽中 cx.capture_mouse 捕获全局 mouse_move
    U->>SB: mouse_move(全局)
    SB->>V: on_drag(new_scroll_x, window, cx)
    V->>S: set_scroll_x(new_scroll_x, ...)
    V->>C: notify → 重绘

    Note over SB,U: 松手 → on_mouse_up → release_mouse，hscroll_drag=None

%% 冻结拖拽（同源坐标反算，与 on_mouse_down 点击选中同一逆映射）
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant G as canvas(on_mouse_down)
    participant V as SheetView
    participant S as SheetViewState
    participant C as canvas(重绘)

    U->>G: mouse_down(列标头带右缘热区)
    G->>V: freeze_drag = Some(Col); capture_mouse

    U->>G: mouse_move(全局)
    G->>V: on_freeze_drag(Col, content_x, _)
    V->>S: content_to_cell(content_x, 0) → col
    V->>S: set_frozen_cols(col)
    V->>V: cx.notify()
    V->>C: 重绘（grid 在 cell_to_screen(col,0,BR).x 画冻结分隔线）

    Note over G,U: 松手 → release_mouse；双击手柄 / 拖回 0 取消冻结

%% 状态栏派生（只读，不改状态）
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as render
    participant V as SheetView
    participant M as StatusBarModel
    participant SB as render_status_bar

    R->>V: derive_status_bar()
    V->>M: 读 selected / state.zoom / workbook → 组装
    R->>SB: render_status_bar(&model)
    Note over SB: 纯展示，无 notify / 无状态写入
